menu "Klivox active buzzer"

    config KLIVOX_BUZZER_GPIO
        int "NPN transistor base GPIO (through series resistor)"
        range 0 48
        default 25
        help
            Active-high output for an externally powered active buzzer through
            an NPN transistor. Default GPIO25; GPIO18 and GPIO27 are used by
            DS18B20 and IR in Klivox Wired. A base-to-ground resistor keeps the
            transistor off during reset, before the application starts.

    config KLIVOX_BUZZER_PULSE_MS
        int "IR capture beep duration (ms)"
        range 50 1000
        default 80
        help
            Non-blocking one-shot pulse. Captures received during an active
            pulse are coalesced: they do not queue or extend the sound.

endmenu
